[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0010","text":"────好，第一份工作"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0020","text":"不用紧张\n放松就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0030","text":"OK——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0040","text":"嗯\n但打招呼要好好打"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0050","text":"我跟别人打完招呼后，\n希望透也能精神地接上──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0051","text":"现场工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0060","text":"啊，283的各位\n你们好—！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0070","text":"────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0080","text":"啊、谢谢——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0090","text":"……！\n早、早上好—……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0100","text":"────透，学我一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0110","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0120","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0130","text":"……不、不是，你精神地回应是很好\n但那个语气────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0131","text":"AD女性"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0140","text":"早上好——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0150","text":"啊，您好……！　早────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0160","text":"谢了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0170","text":"——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0172","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0180","text":"拜、拜托了，透……！\n能不能学我说一遍……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0190","text":"诶，所以说────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0191","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0200","text":"啊哈哈哈！\n所以你就一直重复『你好—』吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0210","text":"是、是的……\n……刚才，失礼了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0220","text":"啊哈哈哈！\n真有意思────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0230","text":"你很有气场嘛，看起来还挺像那么回事的\n我还以为是个老手呢……啊哈哈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0240","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0250","text":"喂，透……！\n────如果是那样的话，是我的荣幸！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0260","text":"对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0270","text":"诶？　嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0280","text":"────啊，啊哈哈……！\n不好意思，他好像有点紧张"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0290","text":"没事没事。你叫透是吧\n以后有机会一起工作吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0300","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0310","text":"不错啊\n感觉眼神很有力量呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0320","text":"……\n哈哈哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0330","text":"──透，那个\n那种时候你也可以说话的呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0340","text":"诶？　嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0350","text":"抱歉啊\n毕竟不像打招呼那样，紧张也是难免的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0360","text":"────诶，不是\n就是觉得────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0370","text":"人生，好长啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0380","text":"…………诶……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0390","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0400","text":"本来以为偶像会更特别一些\n结果跟学校没什么两样嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_20000000_01_0401","text":"Motion"}]
